{"build": {"buildId": "MdvmHaz", "mine": false, "ownerDisplayName": "Ezo", "ownerProfileId": "pOhHGFu", "name": "Magic Arrow Amazon (Ezo leveling guide)", "description": "Magic Arrow Amazon from Ezo's S13 starter guide: Normal, Nightmare, Hell and early maps, one stage each with that stage's gear, stats, skill order and notes. Source: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1UbReGCNhqeYQIgYA8ihOyGuGJ1u_lBafCK7IX9wzHIs", "videoUrl": "", "visibility": "public", "tags": [], "season": 14, "className": "amazon", "build": {"schema": 1, "season": 14, "class": "amazon", "stages": [{"id": "early1", "title": "Early (Normal)"}, {"id": "night2", "title": "Nightmare", "note": "1 point in every remaining passive. Start pushing Dexterity (the Matriarchal Bow later needs 187). Max the Magic Arrow synergies (Inner Sight, Slow Movement, Guided Arrow) and Valkyrie; the order is up to you, Valkyrie gets very useful late NM to Hell. Runewords: Lore (Ort Sol), Peace (Shael Thul Amn), Purity (Amn Eth Thul) for the merc. Hsarus belt + boots (or Raven Frost) fix AR. Skystrike is great late Normal to NM if it drops. NM Cows are a good farm.", "content": {"level": 55, "difficulty": "nightmare", "quests": true, "running": false, "statPoints": {"str": 10, "dex": 100, "vit": 160, "ene": 15}, "skills": {"magic_arrow": 20, "evade": 1, "inner_sight": 20, "critical_strike": 1, "slow_movement": 17, "dodge": 1, "pierce": 1, "decoy": 1, "penetrate": 1, "multiple_shot": 1, "guided_arrow": 1, "valkyrie": 1}, "mainSkills": ["magic_arrow", "valkyrie"], "gear": {"weapon": {"kind": "runeword", "id": "edge", "base": "lbw"}, "offhand": {"kind": "custom", "item": {"base": "aqv2", "quality": "magic", "name": "Meteoric Sharp Arrows", "ilvl": 99, "mods": [{"code": "att", "value": 150}], "sockets": 0, "affixes": ["p166"]}}, "helm": {"kind": "runeword", "id": "lore", "base": "skp"}, "armor": {"kind": "runeword", "id": "peace", "base": "brs"}, "boots": {"kind": "set", "id": "hsarus_iron_heel"}, "belt": {"kind": "set", "id": "hsarus_iron_stay"}, "swapWeapon": {"kind": "custom", "item": {"mods": [{"code": "charged", "param": "54:1", "value": 20}], "sockets": 0, "base": "lst", "quality": "magic", "name": "Long Staff of Teleport"}}, "amulet": {"kind": "custom", "item": {"base": "amu", "quality": "crafted", "name": "Eagle torc", "ilvl": 99, "mods": [{"code": "gethit-skill", "param": "44:4", "value": 5}, {"code": "att", "value": 150}, {"code": "pierce", "value": 15}], "sockets": 0, "affixes": ["recipe:hitpower-amulet"]}}}, "charms": [], "merc": {"type": "rogue_scout_vigor", "gear": {"weapon": {"kind": "runeword", "id": "purity", "base": "lbw"}}}, "effects": []}, "progression": {"enabled": true, "rules": [{"skill": "evade", "target": 1}, {"skill": "magic_arrow", "target": 20}, {"skill": "inner_sight", "target": 1}, {"skill": "critical_strike", "target": 1}, {"skill": "slow_movement", "target": 1}, {"skill": "dodge", "target": 1}, {"skill": "pierce", "target": 1}, {"skill": "decoy", "target": 1}, {"skill": "penetrate", "target": 1}, {"skill": "valkyrie", "target": 1}, {"skill": "guided_arrow", "target": 1}, {"skill": "inner_sight", "target": 20}, {"skill": "slow_movement", "target": 20}, {"skill": "valkyrie", "target": 20}, {"skill": "guided_arrow", "target": 20}]}}, {"id": "hell03", "title": "Hell (cheap gear)", "note": "Melody (Shael Ko Nef) in a 3-socket Stag, Ashwood or Matriarchal Bow with +2/+3 Bow skills; any +5/+6 Melody is a huge upgrade, so buy a base if needed. Hustle (Shael Ko Eld) for the chest. Shop +3 Bow gloves (20 IAS best) from Anya/Charsi at Lvl 65+; gamble or Blood craft a +Bow/Amazon amulet. 86 IAS for 7 frames with Hustle: keep 1 Large Charm with 6%+ IAS. Get half freeze duration somewhere unless you use Raven Frost. Farm Terror Zones, Chaos, Cows, Travincal.", "content": {"level": 75, "difficulty": "hell", "quests": true, "running": false, "statPoints": {"str": 67, "dex": 152, "vit": 151, "ene": 15}, "skills": {"magic_arrow": 20, "evade": 1, "inner_sight": 20, "critic